              "type": "message",
              "position": [
                -3.9,
                0,
                -1.6
              ],
              "text": "[Operations log, partial]\n\nDeep galleries cleared today. Power infrastructure inert but reads as dormant, not destroyed. Recommend formal cataloguing once the security protocol is understood. Whatever tripped the automata is still in here with us.",
